  <!--
    ===================================================================
    Force Edge - Dante (DMC3)   TIER 2
    The Sparda with its power sealed. Still holy, just quiet about it.
    ===================================================================
  -->
  <ThingDef ParentName="DMC_MeleeWeaponBase">
    <defName>DMC_ForceEdge</defName>
    <label>Force Edge</label>
    <description>The legendary Sparda in its sealed form - a plain, heavy sword with a demon's face worked into the guard and none of the light it is supposed to carry. The power is still in there. It leaks out at the edges when the blade connects, which is the only hint you get that this is the same weapon that once shut the demon world.</description>
