  <!--
    ===================================================================
    Balrog - Dante (DMC5)   TIER 3
    The king of Fire Hell, sealed into a pair of arms and legs. Blow / Kick mode.
    ===================================================================
  -->
  <ThingDef ParentName="DMC_MeleeWeaponBluntBase">
    <defName>DMC_Balrog</defName>
    <label>Balrog</label>
    <description>What is left of the king of Fire Hell after being sealed into a set of gauntlets and greaves, still hot enough that the wrappings smoke. Blow Mode puts the speed in the hands; Kick Mode puts everything else in the legs. Push it hard enough and it goes to Ignition, at which point it stops pretending to be equipment and starts behaving like the thing it used to be.</description>
